{"id":"n89525-2-6","stage":4,"title":"흥얼거리다 · 自言自语","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89525-2-6-1","ko":"뭐라고 자꾸 흥얼거리는 거야?","zh":"你一直在低声嘟囔什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭐라고","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐라고","audio":"/audio/95d23f1968b7f0de1b5c.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"흥얼거리는","meaning":"自言自语，嘟嘟哝哝","explanation":"흥얼거리다：自言自语，嘟嘟哝哝；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"흥얼거리다","audio":"/audio/d4731f4f4e5bee6429f5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89525","senseId":"2","lemma":"흥얼거리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흥얼거리는","audio":"/audio/b32c5da0a0ff69b2bd42.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"d4731f4f4e5bee64","term":"흥얼거리다","zh":"自言自语，嘟嘟哝哝","audio":"/audio/d4731f4f4e5bee6429f5.mp3","entryId":"89525","definition":"嘴里一直在说其他人听不懂的话。","pronunciation":["흥얼거리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/f06e092ce52b129c69ae.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89525-2-6-2","ko":"너한테 하는 말 아니니까 신경 쓰지 마.","zh":"又不是对你说的，别在意。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너한테","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너한테","audio":"/audio/5fa76a3e890a321be5b2.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做出，作出","explanation":"하다：做出，作出；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"3","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"말","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}},{"text":"아니니까","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"아니니까","audio":"/audio/c8520d7cdc02ebe16dcf.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니니까","audio":"/audio/c8520d7cdc02ebe16dcf.mp3"}},{"text":"신경","meaning":"神经","explanation":"신경：神经","readings":[{"term":"신경","audio":"/audio/601d03a22ce3fa90ef0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13994","senseId":"2","lemma":"신경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신경","audio":"/audio/601d03a22ce3fa90ef0a.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰지","meaning":"费，耗","explanation":"쓰다：费，耗；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、